---

# Config YAML

- Prefer `config/swarm.yaml` and `config/model_registry.yaml` (or active copies under `src/swarm_sdk/agents/config/`).
- Env overrides: `SWARM_*` — document new vars in README or agent docs.
- Validate personas: `uv run python -m swarm_sdk.agents.validate`.
- Name env vars in YAML (`api_key_env`); never embed secret values.
- Prefer editing existing keys over parallel config trees.
